name: Curated architecture defaults and visible experimental support
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART catalog
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use x-ray
require-live-snap: 25 x-ray:read | core-reader
expect-not: x-ray:run
submit: options x-ray:run
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | experimental-options
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 Experimental | options-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 Experimental | options-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 Experimental | options-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 Experimental | options-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Experimental | options-40x12
ask: Does exact inspection disclose experimental support at every size while the default module list keeps the supported reader?
resize: 120x36
submit: run x-ray:read
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Recorded report tier | stored-report
expect: Source freshness: not assessed
expect: unknown
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP | map-still-unaccepted
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Do stored claims remain unassessed, with no model requests or accepted Map work after the reader?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: options x-ray:run
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | recovered-options
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/xray_curation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart retain the experimental disclosure without a model or source action?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
